# SecureMarket — Test Prerequisites

This document describes everything that must be in place before the contract tests can run. It covers tooling, test users, test data, fixture files, and database setup.

---

## 1. Python Packages

Install all required packages into your development environment:

```bash
pip install pytest pytest-cov pytest-asyncio httpx pyjwt bandit pip-audit safety
```

| Package | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `pytest` | Test runner |
| `pytest-cov` | Coverage reporting (required for ≥80% gate) |
| `pytest-asyncio` | Support for async FastAPI test client |
| `httpx` | HTTP client used by FastAPI's TestClient |
| `pyjwt` | Decoding JWT claims in auth tests |
| `bandit` | SAST — static security linting |
| `pip-audit` | SCA — dependency CVE scanning |
| `safety` | SCA — additional dependency vulnerability database |

